---
title: Saga happy path - order placed to fulfilled
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Customer UI
  participant G as api-gateway
  participant O as order-service
  participant K as Kafka
  participant I as inventory-service
  participant F as fulfillment-service
  participant N as notification-service
  C->>G: POST /api/v1/orders (Idempotency-Key, JWT)
  G->>O: forward (validated JWT, correlation id)
  O->>O: tx: order CREATED + idempotency row + saga RUNNING
  O-->>C: 202 Accepted (status CREATED)
  O->>I: REST POST /internal/products/validate (SERVICE JWT, retry + circuit breaker)
  I-->>O: all lines ok, prices
  O->>O: tx: CREATED to VALIDATED, outbox OrderCreated + ReserveInventory
  O->>K: relay publishes (acks=all)
  K->>I: ReserveInventory
  I->>I: tx: atomic UPDATE stock, reservation RESERVED, processed_events, outbox
  I->>K: InventoryReserved
  K->>O: InventoryReserved
  O->>O: tx: INVENTORY_RESERVED to CONFIRMED, outbox OrderConfirmed + StartFulfillment
  K->>I: OrderConfirmed (reservation COMMITTED)
  K->>F: StartFulfillment
  K->>N: OrderCreated, OrderConfirmed (notifications)
  F->>F: PICKING, PACKED, SHIPPED, COMPLETED (scheduler)
  F->>K: FulfillmentCompleted
  K->>O: FulfillmentCompleted (order FULFILLED, OrderFulfilled)
  K->>I: FulfillmentCompleted (on_hand and reserved decrease)
  C->>G: GET /orders/id (polling)
  G-->>C: status FULFILLED
